{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Chick'n Mushroom Soup</strong> you are in a culinary academy where your choices in the kitchen and in social interactions shape your entire life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/66772476c18d53c4af49bff07893a7b2.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/66772476c18d53c4af49bff07893a7b2.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you finally step out of your shell? You have new unique friends waiting to get to know you. Spend your free time hanging out with your favorites, or focus on your studies. Creating meaningful relationships is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/59a019d3aed0feb012901d47de11eba5.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/59a019d3aed0feb012901d47de11eba5.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn how to cook and Improve your cooking skills through interactive challenges that reflect the real cooking process through games. From learning diverse recipes to cooperating with your classmates, every day brings a new culinary test. Will you serve up a perfectly cooked masterpiece, or burn it to a crisp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/e59d61a7c04a9fd791aa0f02c1ffe338.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/e59d61a7c04a9fd791aa0f02c1ffe338.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everyday is a chance to learn different recipes from different cuisines and know the intricacies of cooking. Whenever you make a complete dish or take a test you\u2019ll get a grade that the end of the day affects your academic career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/ccd2e57230350f3133593b356f25f321.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/ccd2e57230350f3133593b356f25f321.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You've never been a successful student in your life. You thought this life wasn't for you and found solace in video games. Just when you were about to lose all hope of going to university, you applied to a culinary academy with the support of a friend. You've never been lucky neither, but this time luck smiled on you. You were accepted into the culinary academy! Will you be able to seize this opportunity and build a new life for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>*All featured characters are adults and there may be some disturbing images in the game*</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish the Prologue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/f8d5902dba6e536b44c0cb67be75b0d5128e47b5.jpg"},{"name":"Finish the First Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/deb193a8db39e663a4c644af5be21203062df419.jpg"},{"name":"Baby Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/a943eebe3f1149ade822f6d5192e2d46228d3ee1.jpg"},{"name":"Finish the Second Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/f657c736c7d8eff92b2a88ada5400ed0d49cb18a.jpg"},{"name":"Finish the Third Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/b94de71a0cd19175f4cd9cb79e05bed93255ea48.jpg"},{"name":"Choose Angel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/cea60d39ea5ddccec23f5f91ffd7b6fc0059433f.jpg"},{"name":"Choose Ryota","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/443dc2892199989d2689560a0057d0ee9426e872.jpg"},{"name":"Choose Elise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/536293a4a83567cfaa94b78bf2b13a63fc8797b8.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Your Desk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/785ccbd051bd00eb19cbb514fbc76d2bebc1bc63.jpg"},{"name":"Disappoint Ryota","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2771590/b65e27eefd525cf216817418e525580e301d7792.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2771590?t=1772728797","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/16679ce828b6ed6a61f8067800e373c3dde6472e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772728797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/ebc2611b171e6e1c75f6e4a004fca81a5800af35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772728797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/ebc2611b171e6e1c75f6e4a004fca81a5800af35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772728797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Localization</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have worked with some people for Japanese and Spanish translations. There might be some mistakes in localization including English. Please contact us with your feedback to get us fix it.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Chick'n Mushroom Soup</strong> you are in a culinary academy where your choices in the kitchen and in social interactions shape your entire life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/66772476c18d53c4af49bff07893a7b2.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/66772476c18d53c4af49bff07893a7b2.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you finally step out of your shell? You have new unique friends waiting to get to know you. Spend your free time hanging out with your favorites, or focus on your studies. Creating meaningful relationships is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/59a019d3aed0feb012901d47de11eba5.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/59a019d3aed0feb012901d47de11eba5.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn how to cook and Improve your cooking skills through interactive challenges that reflect the real cooking process through games. From learning diverse recipes to cooperating with your classmates, every day brings a new culinary test. Will you serve up a perfectly cooked masterpiece, or burn it to a crisp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/e59d61a7c04a9fd791aa0f02c1ffe338.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/e59d61a7c04a9fd791aa0f02c1ffe338.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everyday is a chance to learn different recipes from different cuisines and know the intricacies of cooking. Whenever you make a complete dish or take a test you\u2019ll get a grade that the end of the day affects your academic career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras/ccd2e57230350f3133593b356f25f321.avif?t=1772728797\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/extras_big/ccd2e57230350f3133593b356f25f321.webp?t=1772728797 width=1560 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You've never been a successful student in your life. You thought this life wasn't for you and found solace in video games. Just when you were about to lose all hope of going to university, you applied to a culinary academy with the support of a friend. You've never been lucky neither, but this time luck smiled on you. You were accepted into the culinary academy! Will you be able to seize this opportunity and build a new life for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>*All featured characters are adults and there may be some disturbing images in the game*</strong></p>","developers":["Team Sermath"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771590/ed1894e03395ceac90ae56bfda1cbac0b53009b7/header.jpg?t=1772728797","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS11+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2771590/1768904158/a7acd3d46e0c37a7bf19a59975c88591a215000e/1772649327/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772650688","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2771590/1768904158/a7acd3d46e0c37a7bf19a59975c88591a215000e/1772649327/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772650688","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstati